---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Work">
<section class="route">
  <div class="wrap section">
    <p class="kicker">Work</p>
    <h1 data-split>Both sides of the&nbsp;table.</h1>
    <div class="lead-grid" style="margin-top:26px">
      <p class="lede" style="margin:0">I ran vendor delivery inside a licensed bank, where the requirements belonged to someone else and the deadline belonged to a regulator. Then I built my own product, where every consequence was mine.</p>
      <aside class="glance rv">
        <h2>What each case shows</h2>
        <dl>
          <dt>Agent engineering</dt><dd>The system that let one person ship the rest</dd>
          <dt>Course Kit</dt><dd>Shipping a whole product alone, payments included</dd>
          <dt>Vibe Code Home</dt><dd>Designing the layer other products sit on</dd>
          <dt>Licensed bank</dt><dd>Delivering into rules and vendors I did not control</dd>
        </dl>
        <p class="g-links">
          <a href="/cv">CV</a>
          <a href="/about">About</a>
          <a href="mailto:lucychen.biz@gmail.com">Email</a>
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <div class="dcards cols2 rowsync" style="margin-top:40px">
      <a class="dcard spot rv" href="/work/agent-engineering">
        <div class="dcard-head">
          <p class="kicker">Underneath the other three &middot; 2025 to now</p>
          <span class="badge-pill">Agent Engineering</span>
        </div>
        <h3>I wrote the rules my agents work under</h3>
        <p>Thirteen releases in eight months across three platforms, built by one person. The system that made that possible: a written doctrine, a routing ladder with a ceiling, blind verification, and hooks the model does not get a vote on.</p>
        <div class="feature-pills">
          <span class="feature-pill">617 Lines of Doctrine</span>
          <span class="feature-pill">Blind Verification</span>
          <span class="feature-pill">5-Attempt Ceiling</span>
        </div>
        <p class="links-line" style="color:var(--accent-ink)">Read case study &rarr;</p>
      </a>

      <a class="dcard spot rv" href="/work/coursekit">
        <div class="dcard-head">
          <p class="kicker">Founder &middot; 2025 to now</p>
          <span class="badge-pill success">350+ Users</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Course Kit</h3>
        <p>A course-management SaaS designed, built and shipped alone on iOS, Android and web, with three payment rails in production and paying customers.</p>
        <div class="feature-pills">
          <span class="feature-pill">Flutter iOS &amp; Android</span>
          <span class="feature-pill">Stripe + Apple + Google IAP</span>
          <span class="feature-pill">GCP Cloud Functions</span>
        </div>
        <p class="links-line" style="color:var(--accent-ink)">Read case study &rarr;</p>
      </a>

      <a class="dcard spot rv" href="/work/vibe-code-home">
        <div class="dcard-head">
          <p class="kicker">Built with a partner &middot; 2025 to now</p>
          <span class="badge-pill">Ecosystem Layer</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Vibe Code Home</h3>
        <p>The ecosystem layer Course Kit plugs into. Built so that a maker who can write code can also sell what they make.</p>
        <div class="feature-pills">
          <span class="feature-pill">Dual-Firebase Architecture</span>
          <span class="feature-pill">Highest-Tier Entitlement</span>
          <span class="feature-pill">Webhook Engine</span>
        </div>
        <p class="links-line" style="color:var(--accent-ink)">Read case study &rarr;</p>
      </a>

      <a class="dcard spot rv" href="/work/licensed-bank-delivery">
        <div class="dcard-head">
          <p class="kicker">Rakuten Bank &middot; 2021 to 2024</p>
          <span class="badge-pill success">100% On-Time</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Delivering into a licensed bank</h3>
        <p>KYC re-verification accepted into production against FSC requirements, Mobile ID device binding reused across four transfer modules, fifteen PwC findings closed.</p>
        <div class="feature-pills">
          <span class="feature-pill">9 Engineers Led</span>
          <span class="feature-pill">5 Vendors (IBM)</span>
          <span class="feature-pill">15 PwC Audit Closures</span>
        </div>
        <p class="links-line" style="color:var(--accent-ink)">Read case study &rarr;</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Base>
